119
00:05:59,230 --> 00:06:00,230
You have to believe me.

120
00:06:02,760 --> 00:06:03,840
Believe you?

121
00:06:06,230 --> 00:06:08,030
You knew I was on the counterfeit money case.

122
00:06:08,310 --> 00:06:09,920
You knew I was investigating Sheng Tung.

123
00:06:10,230 --> 00:06:11,590
