204
00:10:18,950 --> 00:10:19,360
Okay.

205
00:10:19,870 --> 00:10:20,600
Red bean ice.

206
00:10:20,790 --> 00:10:21,176
Okay.

207
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:21,920
And fried chicken wings.

208
00:10:22,040 --> 00:10:22,600
Okay.

209
00:10:22,950 --> 00:10:24,256
And a buttered pineapple bun.

210
00:10:24,280 --> 00:10:25,016
Buttered pineapple bun.

211
00:10:25,040 --> 00:10:25,896
