212
00:10:25,920 --> 00:10:26,606
Two of everything?

213
00:10:26,630 --> 00:10:27,366
Yes.

214
00:10:27,390 --> 00:10:28,390
Okay, sure.

215
00:10:28,710 --> 00:10:29,710
