237
00:11:35,710 --> 00:11:36,710
Hey.

238
00:11:36,870 --> 00:11:39,120
That's a pretty serious vow for a kid.

239
00:11:40,280 --> 00:11:41,280
Looking back,

240
00:11:41,870 --> 00:11:43,750
