241
00:11:44,520 --> 00:11:49,070
But as I recall, didn't your father...?

242
00:11:50,070 --> 00:11:51,070
It's okay.

243
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:54,150
You can say it.

244
00:11:55,870 --> 00:11:57,150
It's all in the past.

245
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:00,360
Back then,

246
00:12:00,920 --> 00:12:02,710
my dad would often get drunk and beat me.

247
00:12:03,630 --> 00:12:04,630
He was brutal.

248
00:12:06,950 --> 00:12:09,790
You little brat, how dare you disobey me!

249
00:12:17,200 --> 00:12:20,150
You little brat, how dare you disobey me!

250
00:12:27,630 --> 00:12:29,720
You were the first person who came to save me.

251
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:31,480
You were amazing.

252
00:12:32,150 --> 00:12:32,847
Come on!

253
00:12:32,871 --> 00:12:34,040
You little brat!

254
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:36,200
