257
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:11,000
I know you're hungry.

258
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:12,600
Thanks.

259
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:20,526
Silly,

260
00:13:20,550 --> 00:13:21,550
